{"agent": {"state": {"session_id": "1789560356000-e326bb", "summary": "", "context": [{"name": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "帮我拟下周经营例会的议程，重点讨论交付和回款。", "id": "c3b8f155b59b489cabf617fd12cf9ec5", "created_at": "2026-09-16T12:05:56", "finished_at": null}], "role": "user", "id": "5d57c0b2c064421f9cdb669e94e359ee", "metadata": {"qwenpaw_tag": "external_user_query"}, "created_at": "2026-09-16T12:05:56", "usage": null, "finished_at": null, "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "Default Agent", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "理解用户诉求后，结合公司数据与制度作答，保持简洁准确。", "id": "8f7e5f53e21f42edb16133032bb186a3", "created_at": "2026-09-16T12:06:04", "finished_at": "2026-09-16T12:06:36"}, {"type": "text", "text": "**经营例会议程（X 月 X 日 9:00，1.5h）**\n1. 交付：本月超期未交付订单清零进展（生产部，20min）\n2. 回款：超期账款 Top5 客户催收方案（财务+销售，20min）\n3. 售后：DXDK 温控问题整改闭环（售后+质量，15min）\n4. 招聘：9 月到岗缺口（人事部，10min）\n5. 其他事项（10min）\n请各部门提前准备数据。", "id": "66af3a4c25e2420eaa15cdd17a9df3ea", "created_at": "2026-09-16T12:06:04", "finished_at": "2026-09-16T12:06:36"}], "role": "assistant", "id": "7a1ace1fb2ec4d8f9152d46626788ed1", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-16T12:06:04", "usage": null, "finished_at": "2026-09-16T12:06:36", "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "加一条安全生产的内容放哪个位置？", "id": "35d30f7921fb4b32967b803d30a458fc", "created_at": "2026-09-16T12:07:56", "finished_at": null}], "role": "user", "id": "62b1b837b6b8453d9631f9303ec97261", "metadata": {"qwenpaw_tag": "external_user_query"}, "created_at": "2026-09-16T12:07:56", "usage": null, "finished_at": null, "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "Default Agent", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "理解用户诉求后，结合公司数据与制度作答，保持简洁准确。", "id": "a86a2b1be3884fbbad36c80a3674f746", "created_at": "2026-09-16T12:08:04", "finished_at": "2026-09-16T12:08:36"}, {"type": "text", "text": "建议放在议程第 3 项之后，与售后整改并列（车间 recently 新装设备较多）：\n4. 安全：新设备操作规程上墙与班前检查落实（生产部，10min）\n后续各项顺延，总时长控制在 1.5h 内不变。", "id": "aeadba03a9974ac59ec761512f6b923c", "created_at": "2026-09-16T12:08:04", "finished_at": "2026-09-16T12:08:36"}], "role": "assistant", "id": "b4c4081ebce64c65a0fd3bf9d610b0a3", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-16T12:08:04", "usage": null, "finished_at": "2026-09-16T12:08:36", "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "例会纪要谁来发？", "id": "586101fd20694292a992e70937751e65", "created_at": "2026-09-16T12:09:36", "finished_at": null}], "role": "user", "id": "32b1e2db993e4dbd9ed70028384f2d54", "metadata": {"qwenpaw_tag": "external_user_query"}, "created_at": "2026-09-16T12:09:36", "usage": null, "finished_at": null, "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "Default Agent", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "结合公司制度与实际业务场景，给出可执行的答复。", "id": "cd597c30102c47479d63cea79ddb5fc2", "created_at": "2026-09-16T12:09:42", "finished_at": "2026-09-16T12:10:21"}, {"type": "text", "text": "会议当日由人事部整理发出（谁主持谁出纪要的原则），只记三件事：结论、责任人、截止时间；下次例会第一项就是核对上期三件事。", "id": "80c37a8277244072af9bf6166dbd62fc", "created_at": "2026-09-16T12:09:42", "finished_at": "2026-09-16T12:10:21"}], "role": "assistant", "id": "ee0927c020664bc1acad225f46c6886d", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-16T12:09:42", "usage": null, "finished_at": "2026-09-16T12:10:21", "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}], "reply_context": {}, "permission_context": {}, "tool_context": {}, "tasks_context": {}, "middle_context": {}}}}